  "details": "I use comfort turning most of the time when in VRChat, but when I am DJ'ing or watching a movie and need to do a more minute rotation, I turn it off. I noticed in the new UI update today that it is not in the settings  quick menu.\nIt would be a nice quality of life change to add this to the quick menu, along with a few other commonly used once, as there is enough space to shift the buttons down and add another row.\nIf it hasn't already been considered, maybe even having a system where a user can \"pin\" certain options into their quick menu so that the settings they use most are available to them.",
